      "values": {
        "Title": "\u0110\u00E1nh gi\u00E1 bu\u1ED5i gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u nh\u00E2n vi\u00EAn m\u1EDBi",
        "Level": "intermediate",
        "ContentType": "reports",
        "Topic": "\u0110\u00E0o t\u1EA1o",
        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "B\u00E1o c\u00E1o gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh v\u1EC1 n\u1ED9i dung bu\u1ED5i h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn v\u00E0 \u0111\u1EC1 xu\u1EA5t chia nh\u1ECF ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng th\u1EF1c h\u00E0nh.",
        "IsPublished": true
      },
      "references": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.0b8d87446fe24122a63245df667d2be8",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 9,
        "VietnameseText": "Nh\u00F3m \u0111\u00E0o t\u1EA1o n\u00EAn chia ph\u1EA7n h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn th\u00E0nh nh\u1EEFng \u0111o\u1EA1n ng\u1EAFn c\u00F3 b\u00E0i th\u1EF1c h\u00E0nh.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "The training team should divide the guidance into short sections with practical tasks.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.26fbbe2db79d46fa830397ceb4dea7b9",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "VietnameseText": "Hai lo\u1EA1i y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u c\u1EA7n c\u00F3 v\u00ED d\u1EE5 ri\u00EAng v\u00E0 t\u00EAn g\u1ECDi d\u1EC5 ph\u00E2n bi\u1EC7t h\u01A1n.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "The two request types need separate examples and more clearly distinguishable names.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.29217a7cb7c74cd49b312dfa3f701aad",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u01B0\u1EDDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EF1 ho\u00E0n th\u00E0nh b\u01B0\u1EDBc g\u1EEDi y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 b\u1EB1ng h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "Ten completed the step of submitting a support request through the internal system independently.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.2c2aae1a1f9f400c89a4fa121b14f2fb",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "VietnameseText": "H\u1ECD ho\u00E0n th\u00E0nh m\u1ED9t nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ng\u1EAFn v\u00E0 tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi phi\u1EBFu ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i sau bu\u1ED5i h\u1ECDc.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "They completed a short task and filled in a feedback form afterwards.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.2fb6b79b60b2460fad88aab15b912a70",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 11,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u1ED9t b\u1EA3ng nh\u1EAFc ng\u1EAFn c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 gi\u00FAp nh\u00E2n vi\u00EAn t\u00ECm l\u1EA1i h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn sau bu\u1ED5i h\u1ECDc.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "A short reference sheet could help employees find the instructions again after the session.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.4e78d0a1cd004addabba8b2eddcd94ca",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u1EE5c ti\u00EAu l\u00E0 xem n\u1ED9i dung n\u00E0o c\u1EA7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EA3i th\u00EDch ho\u1EB7c th\u1EF1c h\u00E0nh th\u00EAm.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "The aim was to identify material requiring more explanation or practice.",
        "BreakAfter": true
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.7f1f6600ebdd43468bd723bc3024f259",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 8,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EADn x\u00E9t r\u1EB1ng qu\u00E1 nhi\u1EC1u th\u00F4ng tin \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0a ra trong ph\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "Some commented that too much information had been presented in the first part.",
        "BreakAfter": true
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.8b629d3dbe1d4329ad62ba7d1e06aa5d",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "VietnameseText": "H\u1EA7u h\u1EBFt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tham gia t\u00ECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u00E0i li\u1EC7u chung m\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng c\u1EA7n h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "Most participants found the shared documents without needing any assistance.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.intermediate.reports.06.ac78cab549cc427faaa178b74223605b",
      "kind": "WritingAcceptedAnswer",
      "values": {
        "AnswerText": "The training team should break the instructions into shorter sections followed by practice tasks.",
        "NormalizedHash": "3b6c6ab8cbb9c73bb398e870b7a85f61126bdc762b9aaa07de5cb138493e6956"
      },
      "references": {
